1. oneclickvirt/backtrace  (Apache License 2.0)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Portions of cf_tri_net_detect.py — specifically the IPv4→ASN prefix table,
the ASN→line M-table, and the return-route classification logic — are a
verbatim port (translated from Go to Python) of:

    bk/ipv4_asn.go
    bk/model/model.go        (M table)
    bk/route_classification.go

These portions were MODIFIED (translated from Go to Python) by the project
authors. They enable the precise identification of China-backbone lines such
as China Unicom 9929/4837, China Telecom CN2/163/CTGNET, and China Mobile
CMIN2/CMI/CMNET.

  Source:  https://github.com/oneclickvirt/backtrace
  License: Apache License, Version 2.0
           (see the LICENSE file in this directory)

